WEBVTT

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.460
Sister!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.410
Why?! Sister! Sister!

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.150
Anyone nearby?

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:27.900
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:33.280
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.940
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.360
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.530
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.700
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.740
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:43.790
<i>I can see!</i>

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.790
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:46.660
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:50.380
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.540
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:56.590
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:03.100
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:09.440
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:14.110
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.700
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.440
Jeez! Normal people at least
have some water in the fridge!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.700
As usual, you live a life
without any pleasantries.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:04.030
There's so much construction
noise at my place.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.840
I can't even eat a meal in peace.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.000
I'm gonna leave this here.
Eat it when you can.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.960
Thanks for the food.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:36.090
It's like I'm in the middle of a nightmare.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.900
I won't allow casualties
like this ever again.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:46.370
We'll have to go to him
before he comes to us again.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.630
I got word from the diner.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.710
I'm heading out.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.960
Hurry up and recover.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:08.430
Our investigation shows that
Knight entered the city from the west.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.470
West?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:15.600
It has been surmised that the place
called El Dorado is also in the west.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:22.190
King, that Knight has mentioned,
is probably the master of this El Dorado.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.360
Take Sophie with you and 
confirm the situation.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:28.950
If a Horror is confirmed,
please eliminate it immediately.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.740
We're taking the girl?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:34.540
We believe King is targeting
the girl for some reason.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:39.960
Please keep her in your sight
at all times and move carefully.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.720
You want us to use her as bait?

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:47.720
We know it'll be difficult to fight
Knight or King while protecting her.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.720
We will be dispatching
Makai Alchemists as well.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.680
Please meet up with them in San Del Dios.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.730
It will take you two or
three days to reach San Del Dios.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.900
Please leave immediately.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:04.190
Beyond that is a lawless area
that we cannot keep in check.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:05.240
Here, huh?

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.410
We hope you have safe travels.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.600
We're going to go look for El Dorado.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.260
Prepare 100 orders of egg drop soup!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:27.930
<i>Shì</i>.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.260
Start passing them out at section 21!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:30.930
<i>Shì</i>.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.260
<i>Nĭ zăo</i>!

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.190
It's dangerous out west.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:44.230
It's been some time since
we had to give the area up.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.530
I can't go against my master.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.200
Try your best to bring back
a result that'll make them happy.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.080
Take care of the city.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.500
And Luke, while you're at it.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.460
I'm thinking of leaving the care of
that stubborn fool to my granddaughter.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.880
Meifang?

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:05.800
Yes.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.800
More importantly,
you're taking Sophie with you?

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.850
Yeah.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.680
Her brother is missing.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:18.390
Her only guardian was murdered,
and she's also being targeted.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:23.610
It seems she was born under a difficult star.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:30.280
My master, the King of
El Dorado, summons you.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.910
I'll make sure to protect her.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.960
Be firm with your stance! Firm!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.740
Want to talk to them?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.420
Hey, wait!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.320
Let's go.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.970
Welcome!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.350
My respects.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.940
Regular or high octane?

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.900
The strongest you got.

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.040
It's bitter.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.830
You were the one who chose it.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.210
True, but...

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.550
The big one is Mount Olivie.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.390
To the left is the Monterey Mountain Range.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.680
Is the white stuff at the top, snow?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.850
It's a really big mountain, after all.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:16.940
Your first time traveling?

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:20.040
Yeah. This is my first time leaving the city.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.650
I see.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.780
What about you, Sword?
Do you travel to a lot of places?

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.280
Yeah.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:28.970
I went on a lot of training
trips when I was young.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.490
I climbed that when
the snow was a lot heavier.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.430
Why do you train?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.330
It's necessary in order
to take down Horrors.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.460
Why?

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:44.260
Why do you continue to fight, Sword?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.550
To the point of going through so much...

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.890
I'm sure it was really dangerous, too.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.430
It's a path I chose.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.900
Hold on tight!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.630
She's dragging us down.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.850
Well, it's work. Can't be helped.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.610
Probably attacked by wolves.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:48.740
I want to reach the foot of the
next mountain before the sun sets.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.110
We're gunning it!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.320
Stop!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:12.800
It wasn't a wolf. Looks like
it got hit by a hunter's bullet.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.610
It got left behind because it can't walk.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:18.140
No way! What should we do?!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.400
Not much we can do. Should we eat it?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.490
All right, emergency aid done.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.790
Now, let's hurry.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:54.680
Hey, get on.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.010
Wait.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.270
I want to stay here a little longer.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.950
She's definitely dragging us down.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.990
Now, now. Don't say that.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.450
Amazing, Lucy! You can walk already?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.290
Lucy?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.000
Well then, Miss Sophie and Miss Lucy.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.000
I'm going to gather a little more fire wood.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.140
Okay!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:42.690
Didn't Sword say that
Lucy needs soft grass, Zaruba?

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:47.560
Jeez, say something...

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.510
Is it good?

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.080
Wait here, Lucy.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.660
I'll get you more!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.250
I'll get the fire going in a bit.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.830
H-Hey. Wh-What's wrong?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.800
Huh? What? Where's Lucy?

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.180
I

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.850
should have listened better.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:01.540
I should have talked more.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.710
I want to be with her more.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.430
Sister!!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.980
Sadness won't disappear.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.240
Regrets are never forgotten.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.460
Even so, we have to live on.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.230
We live and forge new paths.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.060
It's delicious.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.620
Those bright stars make
the constellation Cassiopeia.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.000
A little below them...

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.420
Andromeda?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.590
Did they teach you at the home?

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:20.570
When I was first taken in,
I was taken to the planetarium.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:24.810
I think she wanted to cheer me up
because I was such a crybaby.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.870
Sister was so knowledgeable.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:34.060
Until then, I had never
looked up at the stars before.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:35.260
Yeah.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:42.650
I never thought a world like
that existed in the sky above the city.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:50.020
Sophie. What you see now
isn't the whole world.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:51.950
But it's all right.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:57.670
Someday, I'm sure you will
see the light of the real stars, too.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:15.720
It's time to go! Wake up!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:19.860
Just a bit more...

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.780
If you don't get up...

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.910
Okay! I got it!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:30.830
Get your clothes on!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.380
Let's go.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:38.340
Yeah!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.010
Wretch, did you come back empty handed?

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.570
Where is the girl that King summoned?

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:09.490
I can't believe you had the gall to return!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.080
You even sacrificed my Pawn in the process.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.670
Because of you, my plans are ruined.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:34.130
Golden Knight. You fought him?

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.650
So, how was it? His blade.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:41.400
He will soon come here, chasing me.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.900
Did you tell King about this?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.740
There is no need.

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:57.480
Looks like things have
gotten a little troublesome.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:07.260
I won't allow anyone to lay a finger on King.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:16.480
Hurry and come, Golden Knight.

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:41.090
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:41.090 --> 00:22:45.550
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:49.930
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:54.220
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:54.220 --> 00:23:02.820
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:10.450
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:28.300
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.850
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:41.060
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:48.280
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
